  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "永續智慧零售",
    "sub_ename": "SUSTAINABILITY IN SMART RETAILING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程由統一集團及逢甲大學商學院教師共同授課，讓同學從實際案例中了解「智慧零售」與「服務流程」規劃執行，並藉由課程培養學生具備智慧零售、全通路大數據管理及服務設計應用等相關基礎觀念，希冀結合人才培育與就業銜接。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is jointly taught by teachers from the Uni-President Enterprises Corporation and Feng Chia University College of Business, allowing students to understand the planning and implementation of \"smart retailing\" and \"service process\" from actual cases. Through the course, students are equipped with smart retail, omnichannel big data management, service design, and other basic concepts, hoping to combine talent cultivation and industrial innovation with helping students find relevant job opportunities.",
